1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,740
Forty zombies are leaning on the
only door you have.

2
00:00:02,810 --> 00:00:04,810
And the steel is starting to bend.

3
00:00:05,040 --> 00:00:06,280
Seven days earlier.

4
00:00:06,480 --> 00:00:07,237
It's 3:07 a.m.

5
00:00:07,257 --> 00:00:10,540
You're alone on the night shift at a
highway gas station.

6
00:00:10,560 --> 00:00:11,700
The door chime rings...

7
00:00:11,720 --> 00:00:14,940
and whatever walks in is not here for gas.

8
00:00:15,120 --> 00:00:16,580
You slam the lockdown button.

9
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:18,360
Steel shutters crash down.

10
00:00:18,470 --> 00:00:19,270
Day seven.

11
00:00:19,290 --> 00:00:21,710
A car alarm screams in the parking lot.

12
00:00:21,730 --> 00:00:24,990
By sunrise, forty of them are pressed
against your shutter.

13
00:00:25,080 --> 00:00:28,160
Six thousand pounds on one sheet of steel.

14
00:00:28,200 --> 00:00:29,140
One bolt pops.

15
00:00:29,160 --> 00:00:29,940
Then another.

16
00:00:30,020 --> 00:00:31,080
Most people panic.

17
00:00:31,120 --> 00:00:31,820
They scream.

18
00:00:31,840 --> 00:00:32,440
They run.

19
00:00:32,460 --> 00:00:33,520
You do the opposite.

20
00:00:33,560 --> 00:00:34,260
Shoes off.

21
00:00:34,280 --> 00:00:34,980
Lights off.

22
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:36,100
You crawl behind the counter...

23
00:00:36,120 --> 00:00:37,260
and you don't move.

24
00:00:37,280 --> 00:00:38,740
For eleven hours.

25
00:00:38,940 --> 00:00:41,100
You see, they don't hunt with their eyes.

26
00:00:41,120 --> 00:00:42,380
They hunt by sound.

27
00:00:42,400 --> 00:00:45,160
And forty of them can't find what
they can't hear.

28
00:00:45,180 --> 00:00:46,780
By nightfall, they drift away...

29
00:00:46,800 --> 00:00:47,560
one by one.

30
00:00:47,580 --> 00:00:49,600
Then, on the night of Day 12...

31
00:00:49,620 --> 00:00:50,820
someone knocks.

